      "content": "hey i'm seeing a CrashLoopBackOff on one of our services in GKE. i've attached the logs below but i need a quick diagnostic checklist to figure out if this is a resource limit issue, a liveness probe failing, or just a bad config change we pushed.\n\nlogs:\nerror: Back-off restarting failed container\nevents:\nWarning  BackOff  kubelet  Error: Back-off restarting failed container\nStandard output/error seems empty though. Any idea what i should check first?",
